                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>&lt;b>Références&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ol>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;sub>Parkinson’s Foundation, Statistics, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.parkinson.org/understanding-parkinsons/statistics&quot;>https://www.parkinson.org/understanding-parkinsons/statistics&lt;/a>, Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/sub>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;sub>Parkinson’s Foundation, What is Parkinson’s, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.parkinson.org/understanding-parkinsons/what-is-parkinsons&quot;>https://www.parkinson.org/understanding-parkinsons/what-is-parkinsons&lt;/a>, Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/sub>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;sub>Amiri P, Kazeminasab S, Nejadghaderi SA, et al. Migraine: A Review on Its History, Global Epidemiology, Risk Factors, and Comorbidities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;i>Front Neurol&lt;/i>. 2022;12:800605. Published 2022 Feb 23. doi:10.3389/fneur.2021.800605&lt;/sub>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;sub>Mayo Clinic, Movement disorders, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/movement-disorders/symptoms-causes/syc-20363893&quot;>https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/movement-disorders/symptoms-causes/syc-20363893&lt;/a>, Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/sub>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;sub>Alzheimer’s Disease International, Study predicts the number of people living with Alzheimer’s disease to triple by 2050, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alzint.org/news-events/news/new-data-predicts-the-number-of-people-living-with-alzheimers-disease-to-triple-by-2050/&quot;>https://www.alzint.org/news-events/news/new-data-predicts-the-number-of-people-living-with-alzheimers-disease-to-triple-by-2050/&lt;/a>, Last accessed December 2024.&lt;/sub>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;sub>Mayo Clinic, Alzheimer’s disease, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/alzheimers-disease/symptoms-causes/syc-20350447&quot;>https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/alzheimers-disease/symptoms-causes/syc-20350447&lt;/a>, Last accessed December 2024.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sub>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ol>&#xd;&#xa;"
